---
import FlowShot from '../FlowShot.astro';
import FlowDetail from '../FlowDetail.astro';
import shotCharts from '../../../assets/flow/shots/flow-charts-shot.webp';
import detailChartLine from '../../../assets/flow/details/detail-chart-line.webp';
import detailChartGallery from '../../../assets/flow/details/detail-chart-gallery.webp';
---
<section class="border-t border-border/60 px-6 py-14 sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="tour-visualize">
  <div>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="of-eyebrow" data-animate="rise">Charts and diagrams</p>
      <h3 id="tour-visualize" class="of-display scroll-mt-28 mt-4 text-[clamp(1.85rem,3.4vw,2.75rem)]" data-animate="lead">Draw the idea from the text.</h3>
      <p class="of-lede mt-5" data-animate="rise">Flow draws 34 chart types and 20 diagram types from fenced text in the Markdown file. The drawing renders offline in one house style. Click in to edit the text; click out to see the result.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-text-muted">Select a table, list, or paragraph and ask Visualize to add one chart or diagram after the selected text, never in place of it. A proposal Flow cannot draw is never shown. The proposed drawing appears in review before you approve it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="of-stage of-stage--pad-bottom mt-12" data-animate="plate">
      <FlowShot src={shotCharts} alt="Orionfold Flow with charts and a flowchart drawn in a document from fenced text, and the chart gallery open beside it." crop sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 78rem, (min-width: 1024px) 64rem, 100vw" />
      <FlowDetail class="of-stage__detail of-stage__detail--bl" src={detailChartLine} alt="A line chart drawn in Flow with a direct title, highlighted series, labels, and a source line." caption="Drawn from the file, offline · Text remains the source" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 30rem, (min-width: 1024px) 27rem, calc(100vw - 3rem)" animate />
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto mt-12 grid max-w-5xl items-center gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="flow-path__num">Chart gallery</p>
        <h4 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold">Choose by the question. Revise in one sentence.</h4>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted">Types are grouped by comparison, change, composition, distribution, and diagram. Ask Flow for a revision, review it, then Apply. ⌘Z takes it back because the note remains the source of truth.</p>
      </div>
      <FlowDetail src={detailChartGallery} alt="Flow's chart gallery with a chart type menu, an Ask field, a rendered chart, and Revert and Apply controls." caption="Choose, ask, review, apply" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 36rem, calc(100vw - 3rem)" />
    </div>
    <p class="of-spec-fine mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl text-center uppercase tracking-[0.14em]">Captured 2026-08-20 on a development build. All names and numbers in the example are invented demo data. Designed layout blocks are a separate, later goal, and are not claimed here.</p>
  </div>
</section>
